;; Outbound networking denied — the slice-3 gate and the slice-4 verification of
;; the memory redesign (tasks/memory-redesign/04-implementation-plan.md §6).
;; Usage (macOS; sandbox-exec is deprecated but functional):
;;   sandbox-exec -f scripts/eval/memory/no-network.sb openalpacad
;; The daemon may still listen (inbound) so the CLI can reach it; every outbound
;; connection — a model download, an LLM call, localhost:11434 — is refused.
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny network-outbound)
